pon","cheveron":true,"traitDescription":"When you take the Attack action on your turn, you can replace one of your attacks with an exhalation of magical energy in either a 15-foot Cone or a 30-foot Line that is 5 feet wide (choose the shape each time). Each creature in that area must make a Dexterity saving throw (DC 8 plus your Constitution modifier and Proficiency Bonus). On a failed save, a creature takes 1d10 damage of the type determined by your Draconic Ancestry trait. On a successful save, a creature takes half as much damage. This damage increases by 1d10 when you reach character levels 5 (2d10), 11 (3d10), and 17 (4d10).\r\nYou can use this Breath Weapon a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.","checkboxStates":[],"numberOfUses":"0","adjustmentCategory":"None","adjustmentSubCategory":"","adjustmentAbility":"NONE","adjustmentValue":"0","resetType":"none"}},{"id":"trt_7e00f813b8750d2bc45eec25f1923931","order":5,"name":"Damage Resistance","description":"You have Resistance to the damage type determined by your Draconic Ancestry trait.","collapsed":true,"uses":{"maximum":0,"used":0,"reset":"none"},"adjustment":null,"effect":{"description":"","active":false},"legacyData":{"traitName":"Damage Resistance","cheveron":true,"traitDescription":"You have Resistance to the damage type determined by your Draconic Ancestry trait.","checkboxStates":[],"numberOfUses":"0","adjustmentCategory":"None","adjustmentSubCategory":"","adjustmentAbility":"NONE","adjustmentValue":"0","resetType":"none"}},{"id":"trt_71b7c93c4a2856cef312b93a510b8161","order":6,"name":"Darkvision","description":"You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.","collapsed":true,"uses":{"maximum":0,"used":0,"reset":"none"},"adjustment":null,"effect":{"description":"","active":false},"legacyData":{"traitName":"Darkvision","cheveron":true,"traitDescription":"You have Darkvision with a range of 60 feet.","checkboxStates":[],"numberOfUses":"